{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827180/extras/about.png?t=1757609119\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take a journey into the exciting world of Han Dynasty China, where deceit, deception and cunning lie at every corner of a land on the precipice of division. Play as one of six classes in an effort to best your friends using negotiation and wit in this strategy party game for three to six people.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827180/extras/features.png?t=1757609119\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise up through the hierarchy by murdering, revolting or hiring others to dethrone your superiors. The higher your rank, the more points you accumulate</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barter gold and food with your friends in exchange for items and alliance, however, always expect deceit, even from your closest friends, as social manipulation might be the extra edge they need to win</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you hold the highest level of power, consolidate it by strategically keeping your friends at bay, while still establishing dominance as the one true king and the rightful successor of the Mandate Of Heaven.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonuses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly change languages, in-game and in real time all with the click of a button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827180/extras/42f2e5d9c06783250df32d8910c4a1f2.avif?t=1757609119\" width=595 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827180/extras/3d7e9ed140c36180347c1bcea4803dd6.avif?t=1757609119\" width=595 height=500 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King: Search Players</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eunuch: Block the action of a target player</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard: Protect players from incoming attacks</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief: Steal and item at random from a target player</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacksmith: Craft armour and weapons that you can trade or keep</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farmer: Produce food for yourself and other players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is highly recommended that players use a voice communication program when playing Usurp non-locally</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827180?t=1757609119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827180/6a91c68398adc62ef6ef823840b1a12b44602fbd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757609119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827180/9b2352d31731442ffaf5b4c19a67e578f24110df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757609119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827180/9b2352d31731442ffaf5b4c19a67e578f24110df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757609119","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"descr